{"id":"torrey:feast-of-purim-or-lots-the","source":"torrey","name":"Feast Of Purim, Or Lots, The","slug":"feast-of-purim-or-lots-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Instituted by Mordecai — Es 9:20.","refs":[["Esth",9,20,9,20]]},{"text":"To commemorate the defeat of Haman’s wicked design — Es 3:7-15; 9:24-26.","refs":[["Esth",3,7,3,15],["Esth",9,24,9,26]]},{"text":"Began fourteenth of twelfth month — Es 9:17.","refs":[["Esth",9,17,9,17]]},{"text":"Lasted two days — Es 9:21.","refs":[["Esth",9,21,9,21]]},{"text":"Mode of celebrating — Es 9:17-19,22.","refs":[["Esth",9,17,9,19],["Esth",9,22,9,22]]},{"text":"The Jews bound themselves to keep — Es 9:27,28.","refs":[["Esth",9,27,9,27],["Esth",9,28,9,28]]},{"text":"Confirmed by royal authority — Es 9:29-32.","refs":[["Esth",9,29,9,32]]}],"refCount":10}
